rts":[{"text":"விதிர்த்து","lemma":"vitir","gloss":"having scattered"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and scattering"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மயக்குறு","parts":[{"text":"மயக்கு","lemma":"mayakku","gloss":"delight"},{"text":"உறு","lemma":"uṟu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"delightful"},{"surface":"மக்களை","parts":[{"text":"மக்கள்","lemma":"makaḷ","gloss":"children"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative marker"}],"gloss":"children"},{"surface":"இல்லோர்க்குப்","parts":[{"text":"இல்லோர்க்குப்","lemma":"இல்லோர்க்குப்","gloss":"to those who do not have"}],"gloss":"to those who do not have","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பயக்குறை","parts":[{"text":"பயக்குறை","lemma":"பயக்குறை","gloss":"lack of benefit"}],"gloss":"lack of benefit","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இல்லைத்","parts":[{"text":"இல்லைத்","lemma":"இல்லைத்","gloss":"there is not"}],"gloss":"there is not","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாம்","parts":[{"text":"தாம்","lemma":"tām","gloss":"they"}],"gloss":"they"},{"surface":"வாழும்","parts":[{"text":"வாழும்","lemma":"vāḻ","gloss":"living"}],"gloss":"living"},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"days indeed"}]}],"literal":"Many possessions having acquired, with many people eating / possessing great wealth even if they are, toddling in between / with short steps having walked, small hand having stretched out / dropping and touching and biting and stirring / ghee-possessing cooked rice, to fall upon the body having scattered / delightful children, to those who do not have / lack of benefit there is not, they living days indeed","translation":"Even if they possess immense wealth, acquired in abundance, and eat their meals in the company of many guests, those who do not have delightful children—who toddle with short steps, stretch out their tiny hands, drop, touch, bite, and stir the ghee-laden rice, scattering it all over their bodies—have no real purpose or benefit in the days they live.","modern":"பல செல்வங்களைச் சேர்த்துப் பலரோடு பகிர்ந்து உண்ணும் பெரும் செல்வம் உடையவர்களாக இருந்தாலும், குறு குறு என்று நடந்து, தன் சிறிய கையை நீட்டி, உணவை இட்டும், தொட்டும், வாயால் கவ்வியும், துழந்தும், நெய் கலந்த சோற்றை உடம்பெல்லாம் படும்படி இறைத்து விளையாடும் மயக்கத்தைத் தரும் குழந்தைகளைப் பெறாதவர்களுக்கு, அவர்கள் வாழும் நாட்களால் எந்தப் பயனும் இல்லை.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the Pandiyan king Arivudai Nambi under the theme of Poruṇmoḻik Kāñci (words of counsel). The poet reflects on the true meaning of a successful life, arguing that material wealth is meaningless without the joy of children. He vividly describes a toddler's innocent actions: walking with short steps, reaching out with tiny hands, and playfully messing with ghee-rich rice, scattering it over their body. The sensory details of touching, tasting, and spilling food capture the pure delight that children bring to a household. The poem concludes that for those who lack such charming children, even a life of great abundance and shared feasts holds no real value or purpose.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.53],[0.53,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.22],[2.22,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,4.7],[4.7,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.51],[6.51,7.2],[7.2,7.4],[7.4,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.7],[8.7,9.7],[9.7,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,12.2],[12.2,12.6],[12.6,13.36],[13.36,13.9],[13.9,14.3],[14.3,14.5],[14.5,14.7],[14.7,15.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.36],[1.36,1.8],[1.8,2.4],[2.4,3.3],[3.3,3.65],[3.65,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,5.15],[5.15,6.0],[6.0,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,7.9],[7.9,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.9],[8.9,9.5],[9.5,10.5],[10.5,11.0],[11.0,11.5],[11.5,13.1],[13.1,13.4],[13.4,14.33],[14.33,14.76],[14.76,15.1],[15.1,15.38],[15.38,15.8],[15.8,16.2]]},"sync":[[["படைப்புப்பல","many possessions"]],[["படைத்துப்","having acquired"]],[["பலரோடு","with many people"]],[["உண்ணும்","eating"]],[["உடைப்பெருஞ்","possessing great"]],[["செல்வர்","wealthy people"]],[["ஆயினும்","even if they are"]],[["இடைப்படக்","toddling in between"]],[["குறுகுறு","with short steps"]],[["நடந்து","having walked"]],[["சிறுகை","small hand"]],[["நீட்டி","having stretched out"]],[["இட்டும்","and dropping"]],[["தொட்டும்","and touching"]],[["கவ்வியும்","and grabbing with mouth"]],[["துழந்தும்","and stirring"]],[["நெய்யுடை","possessing ghee"]],[["அடிசில்","cooked rice"]],[["மெய்பட","to fall upon the body"]],[["விதிர்த்தும்","and scattering"]],[["மயக்குறு","delightful"]],[["மக்களை","children"]],[["இல்லோர்க்குப்","to those who do not have"]],[["பயக்குறை","lack of benefit"]],[["இல்லைத்","there is not"]],[["தாம்","they"]],[["வாழும்","living"]],[["நாளே","days indeed"]]]}